x + 1 > x  ==>  true
  wrapping   wrong at x = 127: false becomes true
  undefined  correct
  checked    wrong at x = 127: error becomes true
x + 1 > x  ==>  true, knowing x < 127
  wrapping   correct
  undefined  correct
  checked    correct
(x + y) - y  ==>  x
  wrapping   correct
  undefined  correct
  checked    wrong at x = -128, y = -128: error becomes -128
x * 2  ==>  x + x
  wrapping   correct
  undefined  correct
  checked    correct
(x + y) + z  ==>  x + (y + z)
  wrapping   correct
  undefined  wrong at x = -128, y = 1, z = 127: 0 becomes undefined
  checked    wrong at x = -128, y = -127, z = 127: error becomes -128
